        -- Du tien luon, khong thi pha may xong van khong mua duoc (Mad Scientist
        -- lay ca ngoc va 500k trong cung mot lenh).
        --
        -- CHI CAT NGANG FARM KHI CO MAY THAT TREN TROI. Job nay uu tien 12.5,
        -- tren Auto Farm Level (1) - dieu kien rong bao nhieu thi nhan vat dung
        -- im bay nhieu. "Chua nhan quest" KHONG duoc tinh la viec: luc moi chay
        -- no luon dung, nen lan nao cung cat ngang farm de di mot chuyen dai toi
        -- NPC. Co may roi hay di - nhan quest la buoc 1 cua chuyen do.
        --
        -- DANG CAM NGOC thi VAN phai xep hang: con phai ve NPC nop
        -- (DeliverLightningBolt) roi mua. Truoc day chot nguoc lai nen cam ngoc
        -- xong la job tat, khong bao gio nop duoc.
        local boltCarried = runtime.carried["Lightning Bolt"]
        local holdingBolt = boltCarried ~= nil
            and (boltCarried.Backpack or boltCarried.Character)
        -- Giu job song sau khi da mua de controller con dua acc ve dung Sea da
        -- luu. Neu chi chot `not Done`, vua co Electro la queue tat ngay va acc
        -- bi bo lai Sea 1.
        -- ============ FIX ELECTRO KHOI VE SEA 1 ============
        -- DONG HO SO NGAY khi da so huu, o bat ky sea nao. Neu khong:
        -- ElectroReturnSea chi duoc xoa trong controller VA chi khi Done = true,
        -- ma Done lai false luc vua vao game -> wantsElectro = true, con boltWork
        -- co san `or runtime.sea ~= 1` nen luon true -> job xep hang -> controller
        -- bay ve Sea 1. Moi lan vao game mot lan di, dung cai dang thay.
